Prayer Beads are a culturally rich art form. If you are a fan of Prayer Beads, this realistic 3D Prayer Beads mobile app can fulfill all your fantasies about them. With over 500 Prayer Beads waiting for you to unlock and play with, the app not only presents realistic textures but also simulates the effect of patina, allowing you to truly feel the texture and fun of playing with Prayer Beads.

Advanced 3D technology realistically reproduces the design and texture of Prayer Beads. Through sliding gestures, you can truly feel the sensation of Prayer Beads rolling in your hand, as if you are interacting with a real set of Prayer Beads. This is a very comfortable way to relax and relieve stress, allowing you to find peace of mind in the midst of busy work, study, or life.

In addition, this app can also add a patina effect to the Prayer Beads, allowing you to intuitively feel the entire process from roughness to patina, and experience the historical accumulation of these Prayer Beads. Through these detailed and realistic simulation effects, your fingers will unconsciously manipulate them. Whether you are on a bus, subway, airplane, high-speed train, or traveling, you can play with them anytime and anywhere, feel relaxed and comfortable.

If you want to truly feel the relaxation and joy that Prayer Beads bring, please download this Prayer Beads simulation app to experience the most realistic 3D simulation effects and deep Zen and relaxation experience.

[How to play]

1. Slide down to roll the Prayer Beads. Each slide increases the count by 1;
2. By sliding, the Prayer Beads will become smoother and smoother until they become patinaed.
3. By sliding, you can also continuously upgrade the level of the Prayer Beads;
4. Slide up to open unlocked Prayer Beads and quickly switch between unlocked Prayer Beads;
5. Swipe left or right to switch between unlocked Prayer Beads;
6. In the settings page, there are more rich functions to use.

